  "stac_version": "1.0.0",
  "title": "Kaguya SP Polar Mineral Maps (Lemelin et al. 2022)",
  "description": "Abundance maps of plagioclase, olivine, low-calcium pyroxene and high-calcium pyroxene for the north and south polar regions (50-90N, 50-90S), derived from Kaguya Spectral Profiler reflectance scaled to LRO LOLA 1064 nm reflectance (Lemelin et al. 2022). Polar Stereographic, 1 km/pixel. Low- and high-calcium pyroxene are grouped with the MI orthopyroxene and clinopyroxene maps. Source GeoTIFFs store weight fraction; the COGs store wt% in IAU:30130 (north) and IAU:30135 (south).",
